    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sec-6-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6(3) Engagement of employees in Department or Executive Agency" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) This section does not, by implication, affect any power that an Agency Head might otherwise have to engage persons as independent contractors.   Interpretation  Part 2  Section 7 Public Service Act 1999 Compilation date: 11/12/2024" ;
