    skos:prefLabel "10(5) APS Values"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The APS is apolitical and provides the Government with advice that is frank, honest, timely and based on the best available evidence.   The Australian Public Service  Part 3  Section 10A Public Service Act 1999 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 Stewardship" ;
