concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-14-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14(3) Agency Heads and statutory office holders bound by Code of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-14-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In this section: statutory office holder means a person who holds any office or appointment under an Act, being an office or appointment that is prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this definition." ;
