    cof:title "23(6) Classification Rules" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) In this section: industrial instrument means: (a) a modern award; or (b) an enterprise agreement; or (c) a workplace determination; or (d) a WR Act transitional instrument; or (e) a transitional APCS." ;
