concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-24-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24(5) Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-24-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A determination under subsection (3) overrides the following, to the extent of any inconsistency: (a) a determination under subsection (1); (b) the Australian Fair Pay and Conditions Standard; (c) the National Employment Standards." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A determination under subsection (3) overrides the following, to the extent of any inconsistency: (a) a determination under subsection (1); (b) the Australian Fair Pay and Conditions Standard; (c) the National Employment Standards."@en ;
