concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-39-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "39(2) Heads of Mission"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-39-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) An Agency Head must comply with any direction in writing by the Agency Minister: (a) directing the Agency Head to engage a particular person as an APS employee so that the person can become a Head of Mission; or (b) directing the Agency Head to assign particular duties to an APS employee who has been appointed as a Head of Mission." ;
    skos:definition "(2) An Agency Head must comply with any direction in writing by the Agency Minister: (a) directing the Agency Head to engage a particular person as an APS employee so that the person can become a Head of Mission; or (b) directing the Agency Head to assign particular duties to an APS employee who has been appointed as a Head of Mission."@en ;
