    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner has the following functions: (a) to strengthen the professionalism of the APS and facilitate continuous improvement in workforce management in the APS; (b) to uphold high standards of integrity and conduct in the APS; (c) to monitor, review and report on APS capabilities within and between Agencies to promote high standards of accountability, effectiveness and performance." ;
