concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41a-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41A(2) Inquiry into alleged breach of Code of Conduct by Agency"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41a-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Commissioner must report on the results of an inquiry and determination under this section (including, if relevant, recommendations for sanctions) to: (a) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, a Secretary—the Prime Minister; or (b) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the Head of an Executive Agency—the Agency Minister; or (c) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the Head of a Statutory Agency that is prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph—the Presiding Officers; or (d) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the Head of a Statutory Agency that is not prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of paragraph (c)—the Agency Minister." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Commissioner must report on the results of an inquiry and determination under this section (including, if relevant, recommendations for sanctions) to: (a) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, a Secretary—the Prime Minister; or (b) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the Head of an Executive Agency—the Agency Minister; or (c) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the Head of a Statutory Agency that is prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph—the Presiding Officers; or (d) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the Head of a Statutory Agency that is not prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of paragraph (c)—the Agency Minister."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4f8c5b4228019368a66d32349a07c0d1ec492f47ce64215f0f788f00355fb0a2" ;
    values:partOf concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41a ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Report results of inquiry and determination to specified authorities." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
