doc:sec-41b-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41B(2) Inquiry into alleged breach of Code of Conduct by APS" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Prime Minister may make a request under paragraph (1)(a) in relation to an alleged breach of the Code of Conduct of which the Prime Minister has become aware as a result of, or in the course of, a systems review or a special review. Procedures for inquiry" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer .

concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41B(3) Inquiry into alleged breach of Code of Conduct by APS"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commissioner must establish written procedures for inquiring into and determining whether an APS employee, or a former APS employee, in an Agency has breached the Code of Conduct (including by engaging in conduct referred to in subsection 15(2A)). The procedures: (a) must comply with basic procedural requirements prescribed by the regulations; and (b) must have due regard to procedural fairness." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Commissioner must establish written procedures for inquiring into and determining whether an APS employee, or a former APS employee, in an Agency has breached the Code of Conduct (including by engaging in conduct referred to in subsection 15(2A)). The procedures: (a) must comply with basic procedural requirements prescribed by the regulations; and (b) must have due regard to procedural fairness."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "656572e96b3171be54583819b841b2229d3f8de1aa5940eeaa7c0a3c7d4bdb7c" ;
    values:partOf concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41b ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Establish written procedures for inquiring into alleged breach of Code of Conduct by APS employees." ;
