concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41b-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41B(7) Inquiry into alleged breach of Code of Conduct by APS"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41b-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) For the purposes of inquiring into and determining whether an APS employee, or a former APS employee, in an Agency has breached the Code of Conduct, the Commissioner may exercise the same powers as the Agency Head may exercise in determining whether an APS employee, or a former APS employee, in the Agency has breached the Code of Conduct. Report on results of inquiry" ;
    skos:definition "(7) For the purposes of inquiring into and determining whether an APS employee, or a former APS employee, in an Agency has breached the Code of Conduct, the Commissioner may exercise the same powers as the Agency Head may exercise in determining whether an APS employee, or a former APS employee, in the Agency has breached the Code of Conduct. Report on results of inquiry"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a8e9fa7a21d3902a97ecfd90b450be33549ac0e6340a967a0620802dcb355c7a" ;
    values:partOf concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41b ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commissioner may exercise powers to determine breach of Code of Conduct." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
