doc:sec-41b-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41B(7) Inquiry into alleged breach of Code of Conduct by APS" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) For the purposes of inquiring into and determining whether an APS employee, or a former APS employee, in an Agency has breached the Code of Conduct, the Commissioner may exercise the same powers as the Agency Head may exercise in determining whether an APS employee, or a former APS employee, in the Agency has breached the Code of Conduct. Report on results of inquiry" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer .

concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41b-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41B(8) Inquiry into alleged breach of Code of Conduct by APS"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41b-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) The Commissioner must report on the results of an inquiry and determination under this section (including an inquiry that is discontinued) in relation to an APS employee, or a former APS employee, in an Agency to: (a) the Agency Head; and (b) if the Prime Minister requested the inquiry—the Prime Minister. Recommendation of sanctions" ;
    skos:definition "(8) The Commissioner must report on the results of an inquiry and determination under this section (including an inquiry that is discontinued) in relation to an APS employee, or a former APS employee, in an Agency to: (a) the Agency Head; and (b) if the Prime Minister requested the inquiry—the Prime Minister. Recommendation of sanctions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fbbbc05351a495a172d215f225e0722f362643452a77482b54e9081e20782cca" ;
    values:partOf concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41b ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Report inquiry results to Agency Head and Prime Minister" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <public-service-act-1999.pdf> ;
    dc:source "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.40" ;
