doc:sec-44b-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "44B(1) Action plans" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If: (a) a capability review of an Agency is undertaken under subsection 44A(1) or (3); and (b) a written report of the review is given to the Agency Head of the Agency under subparagraph 44A(4)(c)(ii); then the Agency Head must, within 90 days after the report is given to the Agency Head: (c) prepare a written action plan that includes the Agency Head’s response to the findings included in the report; and (d) publish the action plan on an Agency website." ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer .

concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-44b-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44B(2) Action plans"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44b-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, the person who caused the capability review into the Agency to be undertaken may, by writing: (a) authorise the Agency Head to remove specified material from the copy of the action plan that is published; or (b) exempt the Agency Head from publishing the action plan; if publishing the material or the action plan (as the case may be) would, or could reasonably be expected to, damage: (c) the security of the Commonwealth; or (d) the defence of the Commonwealth; or (e) the international relations of the Commonwealth.   The Australian Public Service Commissioner  Part 5 Commissioner’s appointment, conditions etc.  Division 2 Section 45 Public Service Act 1999 Compilation date: 11/12/2024" ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, the person who caused the capability review into the Agency to be undertaken may, by writing: (a) authorise the Agency Head to remove specified material from the copy of the action plan that is published; or (b) exempt the Agency Head from publishing the action plan; if publishing the material or the action plan (as the case may be) would, or could reasonably be expected to, damage: (c) the security of the Commonwealth; or (d) the defence of the Commonwealth; or (e) the international relations of the Commonwealth.   The Australian Public Service Commissioner  Part 5 Commissioner’s appointment, conditions etc.  Division 2 Section 45 Public Service Act 1999 Compilation date: 11/12/2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3798400439e13858eaedd21a2210c74d5f2e608d37affc339aa47c1c9028ccd2" ;
    values:partOf concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-44b ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Authorise Agency Head to remove material from action plan or exempt publishing" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <public-service-act-1999.pdf> ;
    dc:source "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.48" ;
