    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Governor-General may, by written instrument, on the recommendation of the Prime Minister, appoint one or more Special Commissioners to assist the Commissioner in conducting a specified systems review or special review, or a part of such a review." ;
    cof:pageNumber "51"^^xsd:integer .

