concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-60 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "60 Engagement of former Secretaries"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-60 ;
    values:originalText "At any time after the appointment of a Secretary is terminated under section 56 or 59, the Prime Minister, on behalf of the Commonwealth, may engage the former Secretary to perform   Secretaries of Departments  Part 7  Section 61 Public Service Act 1999 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 specified duties (otherwise than as an APS employee), on terms and conditions determined by the Prime Minister." ;
    skos:definition "At any time after the appointment of a Secretary is terminated under section 56 or 59, the Prime Minister, on behalf of the Commonwealth, may engage the former Secretary to perform   Secretaries of Departments  Part 7  Section 61 Public Service Act 1999 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 specified duties (otherwise than as an APS employee), on terms and conditions determined by the Prime Minister."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "754df54a4fc8d49963830485668efa87fea6a0e9766df00d9d1e12df3e56c462" ;
