    values:originalText "(2) The purpose of a long-term insights report is to make available: (a) information about medium-term and long-term trends, risks, and opportunities that affect or may affect Australia or Australian society; and (b) information and impartial analysis relating to those trends, risks and opportunities." ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer .

