    skos:prefLabel "64A(3B) Long-term insights reports"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-64a-ss-3b ;
    values:originalText "(3B) The Public Service Minister must cause a copy of a long-term insights report to be tabled in each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the report is given to the Minister." ;
