concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-66 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "66 Responsibilities of Heads of Executive Agencies"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-66 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Head of an Executive Agency, under the Agency Minister, is responsible for managing the Agency. (2) The Head of an Executive Agency must assist the Agency Minister to fulfil the Agency Minister’s accountability obligations to the Parliament to provide factual information, as required by the Parliament, in relation to the operation and administration of the Agency.   Executive Agencies  Part 9  Section 67 Public Service Act 1999 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (3) The Head of an Executive Agency is accountable to the government, the Parliament and the public in the same way as the Secretary of a Department." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Head of an Executive Agency, under the Agency Minister, is responsible for managing the Agency. (2) The Head of an Executive Agency must assist the Agency Minister to fulfil the Agency Minister’s accountability obligations to the Parliament to provide factual information, as required by the Parliament, in relation to the operation and administration of the Agency.   Executive Agencies  Part 9  Section 67 Public Service Act 1999 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (3) The Head of an Executive Agency is accountable to the government, the Parliament and the public in the same way as the Secretary of a Department."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "26aada263b1b199c2406eca17549ad0ecf697ceb8be8ea6b0765fd4f01895fc7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "66"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-66-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-66-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-66-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <public-service-act-1999.pdf> ;
    dc:source "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.66" .
