doc:sec-72b-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "72B(3) Protection of information—Merit Protection Commissioner’s" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) An entrusted person may make a record of, disclose or otherwise use protected information for the purposes of, or in connection with, the performance of functions or duties, or the exercise of powers, under this Act or the regulations. Authorised disclosure of protected information by the Merit Protection Commissioner" ;
