concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-72e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "72E Release of personal information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-72e ;
    values:originalText "The regulations:   Protection of information  Part 10A  Section 72E Public Service Act 1999 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (a) may authorise the use or disclosure, in specific circumstances, of personal information (within the meaning of the Privacy Act 1988); and (b) may impose restrictions on the collection, storage, access, further use or further disclosure of personal information used or disclosed under regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (a). Note: The Freedom of Information Act 1982 and the Privacy Act 1988 have rules about the use and disclosure of personal information." ;
    skos:definition "The regulations:   Protection of information  Part 10A  Section 72E Public Service Act 1999 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (a) may authorise the use or disclosure, in specific circumstances, of personal information (within the meaning of the Privacy Act 1988); and (b) may impose restrictions on the collection, storage, access, further use or further disclosure of personal information used or disclosed under regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (a). Note: The Freedom of Information Act 1982 and the Privacy Act 1988 have rules about the use and disclosure of personal information."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cf1445b90742a0159e38333cdf0aca588ef588016b7c7b828125455f7be6a194" ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Authorises use or disclosure of personal information in specific circumstances." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <public-service-act-1999.pdf> ;
    dc:source "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.80" ;
    cml:asserts concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-72e-norm .
