concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-78-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78(8) Delegations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-78-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) An Agency Head cannot, under subsection (7), delegate powers or functions to an outsider without the prior written consent of the Commissioner. For this purpose, outsider means a person other than: (a) an APS employee; or (b) a person appointed to an office by the Governor-General, or by a Minister, under a law of the Commonwealth; or (c) a member of the Australian Defence Force." ;
    skos:definition "(8) An Agency Head cannot, under subsection (7), delegate powers or functions to an outsider without the prior written consent of the Commissioner. For this purpose, outsider means a person other than: (a) an APS employee; or (b) a person appointed to an office by the Governor-General, or by a Minister, under a law of the Commonwealth; or (c) a member of the Australian Defence Force."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "04a4002ca3c95f6901404ee2d12bdf5a15b359546bbf75d2ff64448e8419cbc4" ;
    values:partOf concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-78 ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prior written consent required for delegation of powers or functions to an outsider." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
