doc:sec-78-ss-8 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "78(8) Delegations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(8) An Agency Head cannot, under subsection (7), delegate powers or functions to an outsider without the prior written consent of the Commissioner. For this purpose, outsider means a person other than: (a) an APS employee; or (b) a person appointed to an office by the Governor-General, or by a Minister, under a law of the Commonwealth; or (c) a member of the Australian Defence Force." ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer .

concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-78-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78(9) Delegations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-78-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) A person (the first delegate) to whom powers or functions are delegated under subsection (5), (6) or (7) may, in writing, delegate any of those powers or functions to another person (the second delegate). However, if the first delegate is subject to directions in relation to the exercise of a power or function delegated under this subsection, the first delegate must give corresponding directions to the second delegate." ;
    skos:definition "(9) A person (the first delegate) to whom powers or functions are delegated under subsection (5), (6) or (7) may, in writing, delegate any of those powers or functions to another person (the second delegate). However, if the first delegate is subject to directions in relation to the exercise of a power or function delegated under this subsection, the first delegate must give corresponding directions to the second delegate."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bb1ff40a74f3c246e59cdea41ab74ff65e5abb90ea5b5a2eca165f46491165fd" ;
    values:partOf concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-78 ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person delegated powers or functions must give corresponding directions to the second delegate." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <public-service-act-1999.pdf> ;
