concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-78-ss-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78(12) Delegations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-78-ss-12 ;
    values:originalText "(12) In this section: former senior official means: (a) a person who held, but no longer holds, an office or appointment under an Act; or (b) a person who was, but is no longer, an SES employee, and who does not hold an office or appointment under an Act. senior official means: (a) a person who holds any office or appointment under an Act; or (b) an SES employee or acting SES employee." ;
    skos:definition "(12) In this section: former senior official means: (a) a person who held, but no longer holds, an office or appointment under an Act; or (b) a person who was, but is no longer, an SES employee, and who does not hold an office or appointment under an Act. senior official means: (a) a person who holds any office or appointment under an Act; or (b) an SES employee or acting SES employee."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "264ecfd63ef18ba2423d6b698a79ca30a0f65876b11f3b76dcef977f9a83eeb0" ;
    values:partOf concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-78 ;
