    values:originalText "(2) The Agency Head of an Agency must: (a) prepare an action plan that sets out the Agency Head’s response to the census results, so far as those results relate to the Agency; and (b) do so as soon as practicable after those results are made known to the Agency Head. Publication of census results and action plan" ;
